# Shipment documents are never committed — they are customer data.
src/test/fixtures/*.pdf

# What the app produces is customer data too, and on Linux the webview saves a
# download into the working directory — which is this repository when run from
# source. Named for what the app writes: `<invoice>_<target>.txt` for a keying
# sheet, `<invoice>_SLI_<carrier>.pdf` for a filled form.
*_fedex-ship-manager.txt
*_ups-worldship.txt
*_SLI_*.pdf
